{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15135","headline":"轻薄篇 · 李益","name":"轻薄篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豪不必驰千骑，雄不在垂双鞬。\n天生俊气自相逐，出与鵰鹗同飞翻。\n朝行九衢不得意，下鞭走马城西原。\n忽闻燕雁一声去，回鞍挟弹平陵园。\n归来青楼曲未半，美人玉色当金尊。\n淮阴少年不相下，酒酣半笑倚市门。\n安知我有不平色，白日欲落红尘昏。\n死生容易如反掌，得意失意由一言。\n少年但饮莫相问，此中报讐亦报恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}